        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">To arrange a same‑day shift, contact the Index branch via phone or the online instant estimate form. Provide your pickup address, destination, and inventory details. The team verifies vehicle availability, confirms the 100% insured coverage, and dispatches a crew within a few hours, ensuring compliance with IBA standards.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required for a household move from Index to a major transport hub?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You will need a valid government‑issued ID, the GST‑registered invoice of the moving company, a signed packing list, and any specific permits for oversized items. If the move involves corporate reimbursement, include the official claim form. All documents are scanned and stored for quick reference during the transit.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there any hidden charges in the Packers And Movers In Index cost matrix?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The cost matrix is fully transparent: base fare, distance surcharge, weight slab, and optional services such as extra packing or stair‑carry are itemised. There are no surprise fees; any additional work is pre‑approved by the customer before execution, and all charges are reflected in the final invoice.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the 7‑layer packaging protect fragile items during the 850 km transit?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Each layer adds a specific defense: high‑density bubble cushioning absorbs shocks, multi‑ply corrugated sheets prevent crushing, foam edge protectors guard corners, stretch film shields against moisture, and custom wooden crates secure delicate pieces. This combination reduces vibration impact by up to 85 % and safeguards items throughout the long haul.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What safety measures does the IBA‑approved team follow at checkposts on the Index route?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The crew carries IBA certification cards, follows standardized loading‑unloading protocols, and uses wheel chocks and ratchet lashings on all vehicles. At each checkpost, they present the e‑Way bill, insurance certificate, and cargo manifest, ensuring smooth clearance and compliance with national transport regulations.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my shipment live while moving from Index to the destination hub?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes, every truck is equipped with satellite GPS that feeds real‑time location data to the customer portal. You receive a unique tracking ID after dispatch, allowing you to monitor progress, estimated arrival times, and any route deviations directly from your smartphone or computer.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What is the process for filing an insurance claim if goods are damaged during the move?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">In the unlikely event of damage, document the condition with photos, fill out the claim form provided by the mover, and submit it along with the original insurance policy and packing list within 48 hours. Our IRDAI‑approved insurer processes claims swiftly, typically settling approved amounts within 7‑10 business days.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
